        <mxCell id="JhuRPaTmvo4H0k9_CrT0-107" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;Mapping the current workflow revealed that booking confirmations and clinical readiness decisions are separate records.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; This allows an appointment to appear confirmed to a visitor while Intake still sees it as held [W05-S01, W05-S03]. The handoff to Intake is unclear; when a status is held, Dana opens an exception review with Scheduling and Clinical Operations, but no source specifies who provides the clarification or the expected turnaround time [W05-S03]. Additionally, the incident timeline lacks a completed readiness decision prior to the visitor&#39;s arrival, though this absence does not prove it never occurred [W05-S04]. While Week 4 defined clinic needs via testable requirements, this week mapped roles, sequencing, and bottlenecks—revealing a process gap that the standalone requirements list missed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="940" x="100" y="840" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="Scope and Findings" id="w05-findings">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="827" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#183c43;align=left;" value="Week 5 | Scope and Findings" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="1070" x="45" y="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scope" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=15;fillColor=#edf5f2;strokeColor=#5a7c7d;" value="&lt;b&gt;1 · Process scope&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Your name: Jose Becerra.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;Process purpose:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; To map and analyze the current clinic workflow to identify task sequencing, responsible roles, and process bottlenecks in appointment management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;Start:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; Visitor requests or submits an appointment booking.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;End:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; Visitor arrives at the clinic and the clinical readiness decision is addressed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;Included roles:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; Visitor, Intake, Dana, Scheduling, and Clinical Operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;What falls outside your diagram:&lt;/span&gt; Post-intake medical treatment, long-term patient follow-up, and external billing or insurance processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="1070" x="45" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="walkthrough" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=15;fillColor=#fff7ee;strokeColor=#95694b;" value="&lt;b&gt;2 · Check the two paths&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;Trace an ordinary appointment:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; For a standard appointment, the visitor books a slot, the system generates a confirmation, and the clinical readiness decision is successfully completed before they arrive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;Trace the incident appointment:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt; For the incident appointment, the system showed the booking as confirmed to the visitor, but internally the status remained &quot;held&quot; within Intake, triggering an exception review by Dana.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;Explain the gap supported by W05-S04:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt; The incident trace shows that the visitor arrived at the clinic without any completed or documented clinical readiness decision on file.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;State what the trace cannot prove:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt; The absence of the record in the timeline does not definitively prove the readiness decision never happened; it only proves it was not recorded in the system [W05-S04].&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;yhAwj&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;yhAwj&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ZLzG0d ncoeY E8xBUb&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot; aria-owns=&quot;action-menu-parent-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="1070" x="45" y="215" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sources" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=15;fillColor=#edf5f2;strokeColor=#5a7c7d;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;3 · Evidence and model review&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;Source IDs beside steps:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;Booking confirmation vs. Held status in Intake: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;KDcb0c&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(240, 242, 245);&quot;&gt;[W05-S01, W05-S03].&amp;nbsp;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;Dana opening an exception review: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;KDcb0c&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(240, 242, 245);&quot;&gt;[W05-S03].&amp;nbsp;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;Absence of a readiness decision in the trace: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;KDcb0c&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(240, 242, 245);&quot;&gt;[W05-S04].&amp;nbsp;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;Correction made after checking:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; Corrected the process model to split &quot;booking confirmation&quot; and &quot;clinical readiness decision&quot; into two distinct data records, as the initial model incorrectly assumed they were a single tied process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;Remaining uncertainty:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; It remains unknown which specific role or individual is responsible for producing the clarification when an appointment is held, as well as the expected turnaround time for this action [W05-S03].&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;Person or record needed to resolve it:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; Consultation with Scheduling and Clinical Operations leads, or a review of internal standard operating procedures (SOPs), is required to formally define this role and timeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;yhAwj&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr class=&quot;s6NV4e&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 32px 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(128, 128, 128);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;yhAwj&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ZLzG0d ncoeY E8xBUb&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot; aria-owns=&quot;action-menu-parent-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="1070" x="45" y="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="reflection" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=15;fillColor=#fff7ee;strokeColor=#95694b;" value="&lt;b&gt;4 · Learning reflection (reuse your Discord paragraph)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;n6owBd awi2gc&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;Mapping the current workflow revealed that booking confirmations and clinical readiness decisions are separate records.&lt;/span&gt; This allows an appointment to appear confirmed to a visitor while Intake still sees it as held [W05-S01, W05-S03]. The handoff to Intake is unclear; when a status is held, Dana opens an exception review with Scheduling and Clinical Operations, but no source specifies who provides the clarification or the expected turnaround time [W05-S03]. Additionally, the incident timeline lacks a completed readiness decision prior to the visitor&#39;s arrival, though this absence does not prove it never occurred [W05-S04]. While Week 4 defined clinic needs via testable requirements, this week mapped roles, sequencing, and bottlenecks—revealing a process gap that the standalone requirements list missed.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;yhAwj&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr class=&quot;s6NV4e&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; margin: 32px 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(128, 128, 128);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;yhAwj&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ZLzG0d ncoeY E8xBUb&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);&quot; aria-owns=&quot;action-menu-parent-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="1070" x="45" y="525" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="evidence" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=14;fillColor=#edf5f2;strokeColor=#5a7c7d;" value="&lt;b&gt;5 · Portfolio evidence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[Editable model filename and Week05/Evidence/Week05_Discord_Post.png or .jpg. If Discord is unavailable, identify the equivalent reflection used here.]&lt;br&gt;Save the .drawio file; export both pages as one PDF; check readability; commit and push." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="1070" x="45" y="680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
